validator accepts: let/tuple/field/apply/if/construct
validator accepts: single-parameter function
validator accepts: else-less if with unit result
constructors: ident constant let function apply tuple construct field ifthenelse
printer: (fun[eq_int] 1 2)
reference: fun[absolute]
reference: sibling[measure]
reference: app[M!.operation]
reference: global[M!.value]
substitution: capture avoided
alpha-equality: threaded shadowing pairs
alpha-equality: binder pairing is bijective
freshening: every imported binder renamed
validator rejects: unbound binder (unbound refinement identifier free)
validator rejects: non-bool root (root expression does not have type bool)
validator rejects: duplicate binder (duplicate refinement binder duplicate)
validator rejects: bound occurrence type (type mismatch for refinement identifier x)
validator rejects: empty sibling name (empty refinement sibling name)
validator rejects: else-less if with non-unit result (refinement conditional type mismatch)
